ulti-window, 2 monitors - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - NVIDIA GeForce RTX 2070 (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.8108) - Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-10750H CPU @ 2.60GHz (12 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nIME appears in background window as if you were typing in it:\n\n<img width=\"368\" height=\"156\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1b73a61f-55f0-4192-9b38-7e472f7eb1b7\" />\n\nIt is only visual, it doesn't actually enter the text into the background window.\n\nThis happens with all LineEdits and TextEdits.\nThis happens in single window mode and multi window mode. \nI am not sure if it happens on all platforms or if it is just Windows, but I think its all platforms due to how the notification is sent.\n\nI have a PR to fix this already.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Focus on a TextEdit or LineEdit (such as the ScriptEditor or Filesytem filter).\n2. Open a new window, like Find in Files or EditorSettings.\n3. Focus on a TextEdit or LineEdit in the new window (like Filter settings).\n4. Use IME in the new window.\n5. The IME text is shown in both windows.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_